 "changes": [
  "resources/Font/*.t1 (the 35 URW++ base 35 Type 1 programs), resources/FontSet/NimbusRoman-Regular-CFF.ps (URW-derived CFF) and LICENSE-URW-FONTS not vendored",
  "src/embedded_resources.rs: URW font and FontSet entries removed; FREE_TYPE1_FONTS (33 TeX Gyre .pfb, registered as Font/<FontName>.t1 after unwrap_pfb), FREE_SYMBOLIC_FONTS (STIX Two Math, DejaVu Sans as Font/HskStudioPs-Symbol.ttf / Font/HskStudioPs-ZapfDingbats.ttf), FONT_LICENCES, unwrap_pfb added",
  "resources/Init/fontmapping.ps: FontSubstitutions map the 35 standard names to the free fonts",
  "resources/Font/{tex-gyre,stix-two,dejavu}: the free fonts with their licence texts (byte-identical to their distributions; see fonts below)",
  "Cargo.toml: package renamed, render feature and stet-render dependency removed (render-gated code is compiled out; unexpected_cfgs allowed in lib.rs), pdf-output kept as a plain feature",
  "tests/free_fonts.rs added (fork tests); upstream tests/ and examples/ not vendored (they read the URW fonts or use dev-dependencies outside the workspace)"
 ],
